  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Equation of plane passing through the points&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Direction ratios&nbsp;of normal of the plane is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#62;</mo></math></p><p>Direction cosines&nbsp;of normal of the plane is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"&#62;\" open=\"&#60;\"><mrow><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>26</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8723;</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>26</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>26</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>26</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>26</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>26</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
